{"4386090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "How To Destroy A City", "steam_appid": 4386090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>How to Destroy a City</i> is a casual incremental game where you pilot a giant robot and destroy the city.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386090/extras/3ea1741e988c10735f29dd3f6e1b0ea5.poster.avif?t=1781800401\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386090/extras/3ea1741e988c10735f29dd3f6e1b0ea5.webm?t=1781800401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386090/extras/3ea1741e988c10735f29dd3f6e1b0ea5.mp4?t=1781800401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a robot pilot hired by the Super Villain Association. Your goal is simple: cause as many casualties as possible within the time limit. Flashy shops, streams of cars swarming like ants, and skyscrapers piercing the clouds... It’s time to bring terror to this arrogant city. Pilot your giant robot to crush the army and lay waste to the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enhance your robot with over 300 upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386090/extras/b3f25e4e10644c841f067d83bfc3e50d.poster.avif?t=1781800401\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386090/extras/b3f25e4e10644c841f067d83bfc3e50d.webm?t=1781800401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386090/extras/b3f25e4e10644c841f067d83bfc3e50d.mp4?t=1781800401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you destroy a city, you will be paid in proportion to the casualties caused. Use the upgrade tree to make your robot bigger, faster, and stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop special weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond its massive size and destructive power, your giant robot is equipped with a variety of special attack weapons. Cause earthquakes, call down lightning, and fire missiles and destructive beams in all directions. Let's develop new weapons and turn even more buildings to ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet more new robots</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386090/extras/138eeb4923d856fa60ebc86cd31e4087.poster.avif?t=1781800401\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386090/extras/138eeb4923d856fa60ebc86cd31e4087.webm?t=1781800401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386090/extras/138eeb4923d856fa60ebc86cd31e4087.mp4?t=1781800401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you completely destroy a city and prove your skills, you will be rewarded with a new robot. Each comes armed with a unique design, attack functions, and special abilities. Collect them all and be reborn as a true supervillain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The city won't just sit back and take it</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a cornered rat will bite a cat. As your robot grows stronger, your enemies will fight back with everything they have. Helicopters, fighter jets, and aerial battleships will chase you down and rain machine-gun fire upon you. Equip thicker armor and launch interceptor missiles. Show them exactly who the real predator is!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>How to Destroy a City</i> is a casual incremental game where you pilot a giant robot and destroy the city.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386090/extras/3ea1741e988c10735f29dd3f6e1b0ea5.poster.avif?t=1781800401\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386090/extras/3ea1741e988c10735f29dd3f6e1b0ea5.webm?t=1781800401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386090/extras/3ea1741e988c10735f29dd3f6e1b0ea5.mp4?t=1781800401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a robot pilot hired by the Super Villain Association. Your goal is simple: cause as many casualties as possible within the time limit. Flashy shops, streams of cars swarming like ants, and skyscrapers piercing the clouds... It’s time to bring terror to this arrogant city. Pilot your giant robot to crush the army and lay waste to the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enhance your robot with over 300 upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386090/extras/b3f25e4e10644c841f067d83bfc3e50d.poster.avif?t=1781800401\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386090/extras/b3f25e4e10644c841f067d83bfc3e50d.webm?t=1781800401\" type=\"vide