ered rat will bite a cat. As your robot grows stronger, your enemies will fight back with everything they have. Helicopters, fighter jets, and aerial battleships will chase you down and rain machine-gun fire upon you. Equip thicker armor and launch interceptor missiles. Show them exactly who the real predator is!</p>", "short_description": "How to Destroy a City is a casual incremental game where you pilot a giant robot to destroy the city. Upgrade your robot, fight the army, and unlock special abilities and new robots. It's time to turn the city to ashes!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386090/c72163ee1fcbfb4617fcecef5ff651da7ab3a0fd/header.jpg?t=1781800401", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386090/da58d304a5efa09e96c8a12e6986a51d1f202844/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781800401", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4386090/da58d304a5efa09e96c8a12e6986a51d1f202844/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781800401", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5 10th Generation<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX 1660 ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></u